#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:4
msgid "Rich Text"
msgstr "富文字"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:6
msgid ""
"The Rich Text application in CryptPad is an integration of `CKEditor "
"<https://ckeditor.com/>`__."
msgstr "CryptPad 的富文字應用程式整合了 `CKEditor <https://ckeditor.com/>`__。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:12
msgid "Toolbar"
msgstr "工具列"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:14
msgid "|wrench| **Tools**: Show/hide the text editor toolbar."
msgstr "|wrench| **工具**：顯示或隱藏文字編輯器工具列。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:16
msgid ""
"|picture-o| **Insert**: Add an image to the document. The image can be "
"chosen in the drive or uploaded. :badge_user:`Logged in users`"
msgstr ""
"|picture-o| **插入**：在文件中加入圖片。可從雲端硬碟選擇或上傳。 "
":badge_user:`已登入使用者`"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:19
msgid "View settings"
msgstr "檢視設定"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:21
msgid ""
"The buttons at the top of the editor control the display of text editor "
"elements."
msgstr "編輯器頂端的按鈕可控制文字編輯器元件的顯示方式。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:23
msgid "|list-ul| : Show/hide the document outline."
msgstr "|list-ul| ：顯示或隱藏文件大綱。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:25
msgid ""
"|comment| : Show/hide the comments (a red icon when closed indicates that"
" there are comments)."
msgstr "|comment| ：顯示或隱藏註解（關閉時若圖示為紅色表示有註解）。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:27
msgid "|expand| : Use the full width of the window for the text editor."
msgstr "|expand| ：以視窗全寬顯示文字編輯器。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:29
msgid "|compress| : Use reduced width \"page mode\" for the text editor."
msgstr "|compress| ：以縮減寬度的「頁面模式」顯示文字編輯器。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:31
msgid ""
"To set defaults for these settings, for example to control which sections"
" are visible when recipients visit a shared link to the document, use the"
" **Document Settings** dialog:"
msgstr ""
"若要設定這些選項的預設值（例如控制收件人透過分享連結開啟文件時會看到哪些區塊"
"），請使用 **文件設定** 對話框："

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:33
msgid "|file-o| **File** > |cog| **Document Settings**."
msgstr "|file-o| **檔案** > |cog| **文件設定**。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:36
msgid "Editing"
msgstr "編輯"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:39
msgid "Headings"
msgstr "標題"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:41
msgid ""
"In order for headings to appear in the outline, they must be formatted as"
" such. To format a heading, select the text or place the cursor on the "
"heading line, then either:"
msgstr ""
"若要讓標題出現在大綱中，必須先將文字設為標題格式。請選取該段文字或將游標放在"
"標題那一行，然後任選以下方式："

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:43
msgid ""
"Use the formatting menu in the toolbar (displays \"normal\" by default) "
"to select the desired heading level."
msgstr "使用工具列中的格式選單（預設顯示「一般」）選擇想要的標題層級。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:45
msgid ""
"Use the keyboard shortcut: :kbd:`Ctrl` + :kbd:`Alt` + the number of the "
"desired heading level."
msgstr "使用快速鍵：:kbd:`Ctrl` + :kbd:`Alt` + 欲設定的標題層級數字。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:48
msgid "Paragraphs"
msgstr "段落"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:50
msgid ""
"By default the :kbd:`Enter` key creates a new paragraph, adding a line of"
" spacing with the previous paragraph. To add a line-break without adding "
"a new paragraph, use :kbd:`Shift + Enter`."
msgstr ""
"預設按下 :kbd:`Enter` 會建立新段落，並與前一段落空一行。若只要換行而不新增段"
"落，請使用 :kbd:`Shift + Enter`。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:54
msgid ""
"Take a look at the `CKEditor documentation "
"<https://ckeditor.com/docs/ckeditor4/latest/features/shortcuts.html>`__ "
"for a complete list of the available shortcuts."
msgstr ""
"完整的快速鍵列表請參閱 `CKEditor 說明文件 <https://ckeditor.com/docs/"
"ckeditor4/latest/features/shortcuts.html>`__。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:57
msgid "Import/Export"
msgstr "匯入/匯出"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:59
msgid "|file-o| **File** > |upload| **Import**"
msgstr "|file-o| **檔案** > |upload| **匯入**"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:60
msgid "Supported formats: ``.html``, ``.md``."
msgstr "支援格式：``.html``、``.md``。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:62
msgid "|file-o| **File** > |download| **Export**"
msgstr "|file-o| **檔案** > |download| **匯出**"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:63
msgid "Supported formats: ``.html``, ``.doc``, ``.md``."
msgstr "支援格式：``.html``、``.doc``、``.md``。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:65
msgid "To print or export a PDF:"
msgstr "若要列印或匯出 PDF："

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:67
msgid "|file-o| **File** > |print| **Print**."
msgstr "|file-o| **檔案** > |print| **列印**。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:68
msgid "Select your printer or “print to file”."
msgstr "選擇您的印表機或「列印成檔案」。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:71
msgid "Comments"
msgstr "註解"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:73
msgid "To comment on a part of the text:"
msgstr "若要對某段文字加入註解："

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:75
msgid "Select the text to comment."
msgstr "選取要加註的文字。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:76
msgid ""
"|comment| button, either to the right of the text or in the text editor "
"toolbar."
msgstr "點選文字右側或文字編輯器工具列上的 |comment| 按鈕。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:78
msgid "Write the comment."
msgstr "輸入註解內容。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:79
msgid "|send-o| **Submit**."
msgstr "點選 |send-o| **送出**。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:81
msgid "``Click`` on a comment to select it, then:"
msgstr "**點選**註解以選取後，可："

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:83
msgid "|reply| **Reply**: Adds a comment as a response."
msgstr "|reply| **回覆**：新增一則回覆註解。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:84
msgid "|check| **Resolve**: Deletes the comment after confirmation."
msgstr "|check| **標記為已解決**：確認後會刪除該註解。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:86
msgid ""
"To notify contacts in a comment, mention them with ``@`` and their "
":ref:`display name <user_settings_account>`."
msgstr ""
"若要在註解中通知聯絡人，請輸入 ``@`` 加上對方的 :ref:`顯示名稱 "
"<user_settings_account>` 來提及他們。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:89
msgid "You receive notifications when:"
msgstr "在以下情況您會收到通知："

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:91
msgid "Someone replies to one of your comments."
msgstr "有人回覆您的註解時。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/richtext.rst:92
msgid "Someone mentions you in a comment."
msgstr "有人在註解中提及您時。"

